.git
# Bare ".terraform" only matched a top-level .terraform/ -- azure-new-env/.terraform
# and aws-new-env/.terraform (each holding downloaded provider plugin binaries,
# hundreds of MB) were slipping through into the build context and the image
# itself. "**/" makes these match at any depth, not just the root.
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfvars.json
